This product is a processor module and loader set for Ghidra
(https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra), developed by the
National Security Agency and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The SLEIGH, .ldefs, .pspec and .cspec layout follows Ghidra's own processor
modules. The test harness compiles against Ghidra's decompiler C++ sources
(Ghidra/Features/Decompiler/src/decompile/cpp), which are fetched at build
time and are not redistributed here.
